ters. Id X.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:55:16Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Vats bhai apna patent share kardo 😂", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:55:17Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "Nobel is a lurn", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:55:26Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Perrin", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:55:28Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "perrin", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:55:32Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "jean-baptiste", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:55:52Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Jean Baptiste Perrin is correct. Passed away on this day in 1942", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:55:53Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "Perrin cardine pen hain na", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:56:01Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Haan", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:56:10Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "That’s Pierre", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:56:12Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "Thank god.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:56:14Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Naam suna hua lag raha hai but don’t know why", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-17T16:56:17